{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Swidux ships a companion agent skill ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"swidux-ref"},{"type":"text","text":") for AI coding assistants like Claude Code. It contains the architecture rules, conventions, and code templates an assistant needs to generate correct Swidux code without you re-explaining the patterns."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The skill is published in ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/heirloomlogic\/skills"},{"type":"text","text":" — Heirloom Logic’s public skills repo — alongside any future Heirloom skills. Two files:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"SKILL.md","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" — architecture rules (the 10 rules, the dispatch lifecycle, plugin shapes, anti-patterns)."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"swidux-patterns.md"},{"type":"text","text":" — copy-pasteable code templates for "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AppState"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AppAction"},{"type":"text","text":", reducers, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AppStore"},{"type":"text","text":" factory, views, plugin wiring, and Swift Testing reducer tests."}]}]}]},{"level":2,"text":"Installing the skill","type":"heading","anchor":"Installing-the-skill"},{"level":3,"text":"GitHub CLI (recommended)","type":"heading","anchor":"GitHub-CLI-recommended"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Requires "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"gh"},{"type":"text","text":" ≥ v2.90.0 ("},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/cli.github.com"},{"type":"text","text":")."}]},{"syntax":"bash","type":"codeListing","code":["gh skill install heirloomlogic\/sk